The stash is a part of your inventory exclusively for purchased cosmetics from the [https://store.steampowered.com/itemstore/322780/ cosmetic shop] and for items obtained from the [[Founder's Pack]] and [[Pioneer Pack]]. Items in the stash '''do not''' drop on death or when using the [[Crew Beacon]] to teleport to your [[Crew]] leader. <br>
You can access the Stash using the second inventory tab labeled "'''Stash'''".

